<section class="faq-section">
  <div class="container" data-reveal-group>

    <h2 data-reveal>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

    <!-- Category 1: General -->
    <div class="faq-category" data-reveal>
      <h3 class="faq-category-title">1. General</h3>
      <div class="faq-list">

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>What is a disposal bin?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer-wrapper">
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>A disposal bin is a bin that we deliver directly to your home, business, or project site. You load the bin at your own pace, and when you're finished, we pick it up and take care of the disposal..</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>How does the disposal bin rental process work?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer-wrapper">
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Choose your preferred rental dates, submit a request, and we'll confirm availability with you. Once your rental is confirmed, we'll deliver the trailer to your location. You fill it at your own pace, and we'll return to pick it up when you're done.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>How far in advance should I book my trailer?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer-wrapper">
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Our rubber-tired trailers are 100% driveway-safe and won't scratch or damage asphalt or concrete like heavy steel roll-off containers can. They are also easier to maneuver into tight residential spots. We recommend requesting your trailer as early as possible, especially for weekends and busy periods. However, we'll always do our best to accommodate last-minute requests based on availability.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Is my booking confirmed when I submit the online form?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer-wrapper">
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>No. Submitting a request does not guarantee availability or confirm your rental. A member of the Ridgeway Rentals team will review your requested dates and trailer availability and contact you to confirm your rental.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

