        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Can I fill the trailer above the sides?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer-wrapper">
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>No. Materials must remain safely contained within the trailer and should not extend above the designated load height for safe disposal. [CONFIRM exact loading requirements]</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

