          <div class="faq-answer-wrapper">
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Use the <a href="#">Book Now</a> form on our website. Select your preferred trailer, drop-off date, and pickup date, then provide your contact and delivery information. We'll review availability and contact you to confirm your rental.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
